<span class="flagicon nowrap" about="#mwt617" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Flag","href":"./Template:Flag"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Uganda"}},"i":0}}]}' id="mwC7g"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="./File:Flag_of_Uganda.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Flag_of_Uganda.svg/40px-Flag_of_Uganda.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Flag_of_Uganda.svg/60px-Flag_of_Uganda.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="900" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Uganda" title="Uganda" about="#mwt617" id="mwC7k">Uganda</a></p></td>
<td id="mwC7o">
<p id="mwC7s">An <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Anthracotheriidae" title="Anthracotheriidae" id="mwC7w">anthracothere</a>. The type species is <i id="mwC70">"<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Brachyodus" title="Brachyodus" id="mwC74">Brachyodus</a>" aequatorialis</i> MacInnes (1951). Tsubamoto <i id="mwC78">et al.</i> (2025) did not consider the erection of the separate genus for <i id="mwC8A">B. aequatorialis</i> to be robustly supported, and conservatively used the genus <i id="mwC8E">Brachyodus</i> for this species.<sup about="#mwt620" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-163" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-163"}}'><a href="./2022_in_paleomammalogy#cite_note-163" id="mwC8I"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC8M"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC8Q">[</span>163<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC8U">]</span></span></a></sup></p></td>
<td id="mwC8Y"></td></tr>
<tr id="mwC8c">
<td id="mwC8g">
<p id="mwC8k"><i id="mwC8o">Ua</i><sup about="#mwt624" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-164" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-164"}}'><a href="./2022_in_paleomammalogy#cite_note-164" id="mwC8s"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwC8w"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC80">[</span>164<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwC84">]</span></span></a></sup></p></td>
<td id="mwC88">
<p id="mwC9A">Gen. et sp. nov</p></td>
