<section data-mw-section-id="22" id="mwFMs"><h4 data-mw-wikitext="" id="Eulipotyphlean_research">Eulipotyphlean research</h4>
<ul id="mwFMw"><li id="mwFM0">Fossil material of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Erinaceidae" title="Erinaceidae" id="mwFM4">erinaceid</a> <i id="mwFM8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Galerix" title="Galerix" id="mwFNA">Galerix</a> rutlandae</i> and a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Talpidae" title="Talpidae" id="mwFNE">talpid</a> belonging to the subfamily <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Uropsilinae" title="Uropsilinae" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFNI">Uropsilinae</a>, representing the first known record of these families from the Miocene Siwalik exposures of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./India" title="India" id="mwFNM">India</a> and the first record of an uropsiline from the Indian subcontinent, is described by Parmar, Norboo &amp; Magotra (2022).<sup about="#mwt1125" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-305" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-305"}}'><a href="./2022_in_paleomammalogy#cite_note-305" id="mwFNQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFNU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNY">[</span>305<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNc">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwFNg">Fossil material of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Van_Sung's_shrew" title="Van Sung's shrew" id="mwFNk">Van Sung's shrew</a> and <i id="mwFNo">Chodsigoa hoffmanni</i> is described from the Pleistocene of the Tham Hai cave and Lang Trang cave (Vietnam) by Lopatin (2022), representing the first fossil records of these species and the first fossil remains of members of the genus <i id="mwFNs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Chodsigoa" title="Chodsigoa" id="mwFNw">Chodsigoa</a></i> found outside China.<sup about="#mwt1128" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-306" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-306"}}'><a href="./2022_in_paleomammalogy#cite_note-306" id="mwFN0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFN4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFN8">[</span>306<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFOA">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

